          "message": {
            "text": "The engine was already centered; the showcase made the behavior look wrong by featuring only the mixed-family demo, whose parameterized clock origin is deliberately off-center, while omitting the centered standalone asset. Publishing the dedicated demo separates the default midpoint contract from the intentional custom-origin example, and the linked animator test pins clock and iris to the same viewport midpoint.",
            "markdown": "The engine was already centered; the showcase made the behavior look wrong by featuring only the mixed-family demo, whose parameterized clock origin is deliberately off-center, while omitting the centered standalone asset. Publishing the dedicated demo separates the default midpoint contract from the intentional custom-origin example, and the linked animator test pins clock and iris to the same viewport midpoint."
          },
          "locations": [
